OL,3,AAndy Burnham among Great North Run
OL,4,Afinishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Great North Run (GNR) returned to
OL,7,FTyneside this weekend, with 63,000
OL,8,Frunners taking part in the world's
OL,9,Fbiggest half marathon - including Prime
OL,10,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,12,FEngland star and Newcastle captain Dan
OL,13,FBurn rang the starter's bell, with
OL,14,Ffamous faces including football
OL,15,Fpersonality Chris Kamara and fitness
OL,16,Fcoach Joe Wicks taking on the
OL,17,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
